  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fNz5/63",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 3가지 센서를 동시에 사용해서 아래와 같은 실험을 소개하겠습니다!(고등학교 수준)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f76e4d9322f0bf2e665052eaaa2abda8e5951be6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f76e4d9322f0bf2e665052eaaa2abda8e5951be6\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">기존에 열량계 B형을 사면 주는 니크롬선은<br>너무 저항이 작아서 다른 걸로 교체합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27f2c0c4b59c956496ca2d0c61fe5a4ad43d2a44\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27f2c0c4b59c956496ca2d0c61fe5a4ad43d2a44\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래 보면 원래 니크롬선 있는자리에서<br>니크롬선을 빼버렸습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3cf8fd6003515fb3ceee2da03cbcb0cc3e4d1c9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3cf8fd6003515fb3ceee2da03cbcb0cc3e4d1c9\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">요렇게 잘 교체해주고~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4da81802b1431ba42686170433fd96687f763837\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4da81802b1431ba42686170433fd96687f763837\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래와 같이 물이랑 식용유 각각 실험해야 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f7e3a1dfb4c6096ad1c0c835c4c2258aba7d6a1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f7e3a1dfb4c6096ad1c0c835c4c2258aba7d6a1\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3bd8389e49301e7236591ca5d4064cb9ad367b0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3bd8389e49301e7236591ca5d4064cb9ad367b0\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래 사진에서 열량계 안에 꼽아져 있는게 수온센서<br>병렬연결은 전압센서, 직렬연결은 전류센서입니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0fedadde61758d1c4bccf997b5a788407bbac12\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0fedadde61758d1c4bccf997b5a788407bbac12\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">결과는 다음과 같습니다ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ea1cd17fe373a12b9913882617b3205505482f59\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ea1cd17fe373a12b9913882617b3205505482f59\" data-origin-width=\"834\" data-origin-height=\"645\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[여기서 주의]<br>유선으로 연결하여, <br>저항체를 2개가 직렬로 되어 있을 때<br>각각 저항체에 전압센서를 병렬연결을 하게 되면<br>전압센서가 유선이라, 센서 쪽으로 전류가 빠져나가서<br>한 저항체 쪽에는 전류가 흐르지 않더라고요!<br>(전류는 저항이 작은 쪽으로 흘러가버리니까요)<br><br>그래서 원래는 물 담은 니크롬선, 식용유 담은 니크롬선 직렬로 나란히 하려고 했는데, 물이랑 식용유 실험을 각각하게 되었습니다!<br><br>이건 무선보드 사용하면 충분히 해결할 수 있는 문제라고 생각합니다!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Hu0Ky/dJMb8952I1C/qa4bGyrsBuAQZDHmfmLuCk/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Hu0Ky/dJMb8952I1C/qa4bGyrsBuAQZDHmfmLuCk/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
